{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-06-phl-tickets/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:24:31.527Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"1cfc3ecf2e2416906fbbef36b4eff5ec817b4da402ae1b5a67d60886fab07828","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"@Bettina, here's the list. I pulled it from #coastal-team, #coastal-random, and the public Coastal notes from Moss (the digests and the cheat sheet) plus Bettina's Pellucid cutover recap. Pellow Home Living is left out. I couldn't check live ticket status, so each item shows what the source says.\n\n**Pellucid Harbor Logistics (PHL, Gulf Coast)**\n- **#4419**: Yard_Dwell_Summary report times out when filtered by container length. Open per the Coastal cheat sheet. The 2025-11-02 digest files #4419 under \"Puget Sound Operations\" (barge slip 7 schedule sync), so the owner of this number needs confirming.\n- **PD-8841**: Chassis pool holds on double-booked gates (Gate 4B), raised by the night dispatcher at Beaumont barge slip. Source: Bettina's 2025-12-08 recap.\n- **Berth 2 yard map CSV import bug**: Mentioned as lingering in the 2025-12-08 recap. No ticket number given.\n- **Gate 4 chassis pool validation**: The cheat sheet calls this the primary friction point during shift change. No ticket number given.\n- **Gate 4B printer mapping**: Mentioned in the 2025-12-08 recap. No ticket number given.\n- **Container yard expansion questions for Q1**: Mentioned in the 2025-12-08 recap. Kwame has owned the Gulf Coast account since 2025-11-22.\n\n**Driftmoor Marine Freight (DMF, Puget Sound)**\n- **Feature request #882**: Bulk-clear button for departed barges, requested by warehouse managers. Source: cheat sheet.\n- **Tide-table import macro failure on Terminal B**: Engineering supplied a manual CSV patch for the night dispatcher. Source: cheat sheet. No ticket number given.\n- **Patched manifest CSV before the 06:00 shift**: Requested in the 2025-11-02 digest. Completion not recorded.\n\nNothing in the Coastal channels is tagged to PHL or DMF beyond the items above. The Coastal channel messages about Saltmarsh, Covey & Lark / Pellow Home Living tickets (PD-4821, PD-4824, PD-4827, #8812) belong to other accounts and are excluded."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
